  "description": "1. Entrance Door Replacement\n\n    - Remove the existing single-glazed, non-thermally broken entrance door.\n    - Install a new double-glazed, thermally broken entrance door to improve thermal performance and energy efficiency.\n\nThe existing door was installed incorrectly with the door swings clashing with the lobby door into the GF showroom/office.\n\n2. Roller Shutter Replacement\n\n    - Remove the existing roller shutter.\n    - Install a new, narrower roller shutter incorporating a combined emergency exit door.\n\nThe reason for the alteration is to ensure that there is a permanent means of escape via the garage when the shutter is closed, while maintaining access for car parking and off-road unloading in the garage.\n",
